    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 10th level, you are able to interfere with and absorb magic. As an action, you can spend 2 fel points to create the effects of a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.15Fa6q1nH27XfbR8]{dispel magic} spell. When you dispel an effect this way, you gain temporary hit points equal to twice the spell's level + your Intelligence modifier. These hit points remain until you finish your next short or long rest.</p>",
